Package: ggbothbar
Type: Package
Title: Visualise Isotopic Abundance Data
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hidehito", "Okada", , "hidefungi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3210-2736"))
  )
Description: Calculates and visualises isotopic enrichment and grouped
    uncertainty, particularly for mycoheterotrophic plant studies. Provides
    'ggplot2' geoms for two-axis error bars and error boxes, isotope-aware
    labels, plotting themes, and helpers for exporting tabular results.
